[08:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'way to program a NFC tag is to think about what are the routines that you already have and what are the steps that you can kind of automate so that you don\'t have to do them every single time that you\'re going to do this routine. Another routine that I love using my NFC'

[08:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'tag for is my sleep routine. I have an NFC sticker stuck to my side table. When I run that routine, the first thing that it does is it turns off all of the lights in my apartment, but it also turns on the lamp in my bedroom. I have'

